Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.86,JOJO5_textjp,,0,0,0,,(♪ «Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star» әніне варияциялар»)
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.60,0:19:10.98,JOJO5_textjp,,0,0,0,,На
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.63,0:19:16.40,JOJO5_textjp,,0,0,0,,Не?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.55,0:19:31.10,JOJO5_textjp,,0,0,0,,Үй меңгерушісі
